    "title": "Men's soccer returns to national rankings, checking in at #23 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "14 hours ago Omaha, Neb. -- For the first time since August 8, 2023, Creighton Men's Soccer is nationally ranked as the Bluejays checked in tied with Princeton for No. 23 in the most recent poll by United Soccer Coaches on Tuesday, September 1. Creighton has started the 2026 season with three impressive wins, including a 5-0 clean sheet over Tulsa on Monday evening. Read full article",
